+dependencies.
+
+Observed transitive axioms are Classical.choice, Quot.sound, and propext.
+No local declaration depends on sorryAx.  A declaration-line scan finds no
+sorry, admit, axiom, opaque, unsafe, or implemented_by form in the owned Lean
+directory.
+
+There is intentionally no theorem whose type is FrozenStatement F or Target
+F without assuming it.  Consequently the package is an M0-L candidate for
+the statement/diagnostic boundary, not an M0-L theorem closure.  The
+machine-complete axis and theorem-complete conjunction remain false.
